1762562323000	{"id":{"$t":"tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-8657703664257880060.post-7547110494301300740"},"published":{"$t":"2025-11-07T19:38:43.000-05:00"},"updated":{"$t":"2026-11-21T06:30:53.665-05:00"},"category":[{"scheme":"http://www.blogger.com/atom/ns#","term":"Articles"},{"scheme":"http://www.blogger.com/atom/ns#","term":"lang-ne"},{"scheme":"http://www.blogger.com/atom/ns#","term":"Musings"},{"scheme":"http://www.blogger.com/atom/ns#","term":"Nepali"},{"scheme":"http://www.blogger.com/atom/ns#","term":"Nepali literature"},{"scheme":"http://www.blogger.com/atom/ns#","term":"Stories"}],"title":{"type":"text","$t":"अन्तरेको कथा"},"summary":{"type":"text","$t":"माओवादी कसरी बन्नुपर्‍यो, कसरी माओवादीले बिर्सियो? ‘पूर्वछाने बढाउले दोस्रो विश्वयुद्धको गोली बोके, अन्तरेले आफ्नै देशको अन्याय सह्यो। अन्तरेकी छोरीले बाबाले बनाउन नपाएको स्कुलमै पढेर, न्याय जिती। तीन पुस्ताको कथा हो यो- राज्य, अन्याय, विद्रोह र सम्झनाहरूको। भर्खरै… ‘पूर्वछाने बढाउले दोस्रो विश्वयुद्धको गोली बोके, अन्तरेले आफ्नै देशको अन्याय सह्यो अन्तरेकी छोरीले बाबाले बनाउन नपाएको स्कुलमै पढेर,न"},"link":[{"rel":"replies","type":"application/atom+xml","href":"https://www.kafka.blog/feeds/7547110494301300740/comments/default","title":"Post Comments"},{"rel":"replies","type":"text/html","href":"https://www.kafka.blog/2025/11/antarey.html#comment-form","title":"0 Comments"},{"rel":"edit","type":"application/atom+xml","href":"https://www.blogger.com/feeds/8657703664257880060/posts/default/7547110494301300740"},{"rel":"self","type":"application/atom+xml","href":"https://www.blogger.com/feeds/8657703664257880060/posts/default/7547110494301300740"},{"rel":"alternate","type":"text/html","href":"https://www.kafka.blog/2025/11/antarey.html","title":"अन्तरेको कथा"}],"author":[{"name":{"$t":"Unknown"},"email":{"$t":"noreply@blogger.com"},"gd$image":{"rel":"http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail","width":"16","height":"16","src":"https://img1.blogblog.com/img/b16-rounded.gif"}}],"media$thumbnail":{"xmlns$media":"htt