1742581822000	{"id":{"$t":"tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-8657703664257880060.post-1938482688462291082"},"published":{"$t":"2025-03-21T14:30:22.000-04:00"},"updated":{"$t":"2026-11-26T23:46:58.423-05:00"},"category":[{"scheme":"http://www.blogger.com/atom/ns#","term":"Articles"},{"scheme":"http://www.blogger.com/atom/ns#","term":"lang-ne"},{"scheme":"http://www.blogger.com/atom/ns#","term":"Nepali"},{"scheme":"http://www.blogger.com/atom/ns#","term":"Stories"}],"title":{"type":"text","$t":"आफ्नै संस्मरण २- कविताका कुरा"},"summary":{"type":"text","$t":"फेरी कलमले बामे सर्न खोज्दैछ, यो कविता लेख्ने हुटहुटी यस्तै, लागेपछि छुट्नै गाह्रो । लेखिएका कुराहरू ट्विटर र ब्लगमा हाल्दै गर्छु। यो मनोवाद, यी कविताहरु मेरा लागि नै हुन, भित्र गुम्सिएका आवाजहरूलाई बाहिर निकाल्न। मलाई… अब कविताका कुरा- यसका नि खण्डहरू छन्- पख्नु न। कविताको कुरा गर्दा भुपी कसोगरी भुल्ने- घुम्ने बेन्चमा बसेर लेखिरहेको म, हतार के छ र। अङ्रेजी कविहरुमा मैले पहिले किट्स र थोमस भेटेँ। "},"link":[{"rel":"replies","type":"application/atom+xml","href":"https://www.kafka.blog/feeds/1938482688462291082/comments/default","title":"Post Comments"},{"rel":"replies","type":"text/html","href":"https://www.kafka.blog/2025/03/poetry.html#comment-form","title":"1 Comments"},{"rel":"edit","type":"application/atom+xml","href":"https://www.blogger.com/feeds/8657703664257880060/posts/default/1938482688462291082"},{"rel":"self","type":"application/atom+xml","href":"https://www.blogger.com/feeds/8657703664257880060/posts/default/1938482688462291082"},{"rel":"alternate","type":"text/html","href":"https://www.kafka.blog/2025/03/poetry.html","title":"आफ्नै संस्मरण २- कविताका कुरा"}],"author":[{"name":{"$t":"Unknown"},"email":{"$t":"noreply@blogger.com"},"gd$image":{"rel":"http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail","width":"16","height":"16","src":"https://img1.blogblog.com/img/b16-rounded.gif"}}],"media$thumbnail":{"xmlns$media":"http://search.yahoo.com/mrss/","url":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/d/17ILlze4uT1UQcNcs6PJIYj5unXA_P8