1742581655000	{"id":{"$t":"tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-8657703664257880060.post-8461694993083405628"},"published":{"$t":"2025-03-21T14:27:35.000-04:00"},"updated":{"$t":"2026-11-21T21:50:56.518-05:00"},"category":[{"scheme":"http://www.blogger.com/atom/ns#","term":"Articles"},{"scheme":"http://www.blogger.com/atom/ns#","term":"lang-ne"},{"scheme":"http://www.blogger.com/atom/ns#","term":"Monologues"},{"scheme":"http://www.blogger.com/atom/ns#","term":"Nepali"},{"scheme":"http://www.blogger.com/atom/ns#","term":"Stories"},{"scheme":"http://www.blogger.com/atom/ns#","term":"top"}],"title":{"type":"text","$t":"आफ्नै संस्मरण १- किताबका कुरा"},"summary":{"type":"text","$t":"योगवीर, सकम्बरी, फुलहरू र बुढी पसल्नी लाई पहिले भेटेँ, अन्तरमुखीमा आँफूलाई पाएँ, परिभाषित आँखाहरुले पर्खालबाहिर धुपी सल्ला र लालीगुराँसको फेदीमा पुर्यायो, अनि महत्ताहिनले थाहै नपाइ बैँसालु वर्तमानमा लगेर छाडी राखेको… I. सानो बेलाबाट नै किताबहरूप्रति मेरो बिछट्टकै मोह थियो। अक्षरहरूकै छाँयामा हुर्किएको मेरा लागि किताबहरु आसक्ति मात्रै थिएनन्, साथीहरु नै तिनै बनेका थिए। आजसम्म पनि रहिरहेका केही नजिक"},"link":[{"rel":"replies","type":"application/atom+xml","href":"https://www.kafka.blog/feeds/8461694993083405628/comments/default","title":"Post Comments"},{"rel":"replies","type":"text/html","href":"https://www.kafka.blog/2025/03/booksandauthors.html#comment-form","title":"1 Comments"},{"rel":"edit","type":"application/atom+xml","href":"https://www.blogger.com/feeds/8657703664257880060/posts/default/8461694993083405628"},{"rel":"self","type":"application/atom+xml","href":"https://www.blogger.com/feeds/8657703664257880060/posts/default/8461694993083405628"},{"rel":"alternate","type":"text/html","href":"https://www.kafka.blog/2025/03/booksandauthors.html","title":"आफ्नै संस्मरण १- किताबका कुरा"}],"author":[{"name":{"$t":"Unknown"},"email":{"$t":"noreply@blogger.com"},"gd$image":{"rel":"http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail","width":"16","height":"16","src":"https://img1.blogblog.com/img/b16-rounded.gif"}}